n  PROOF POINTS\n  ========================================================================================================================\n  +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------+\n  | Proof Point                                                                            |                     Result |\n  +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------+\n  | Real MonetrixVault.settle path reached                                                 |                       PASS |\n  | Real MonetrixAccountant.settleDailyPnL path reached                                    |                       PASS |\n  | Real MonetrixAccountant.totalBackingSigned path reached                                |                       PASS |\n  | Real MonetrixAccountant._readL1Backing path reached                                    |                       PASS |\n  | Real PrecompileReader.suppliedBalance layout used                                      |                       PASS |\n  | 0x811 borrow.value is non-zero                                                         |                       PASS |\n  | 0x811 supply.value is non-zero                                                         |                       PASS |\n  | supply.value is counted as backing                                                     |                       PASS |\n  | borrow.value is not subtracted from backing                                            |                       PASS |\n  | changing borrow.value does not change reported backing                                 |                       PASS |\n  | changing borrow.value does not change reported surplus                                 |                       PASS |\n  | reported surplus is positive before settle                                             |                       PASS |\n  | correct net surplus is zero before settle                                              |                       PASS |\n  | settle succeeds using phantom surplus                                                  |                       PASS |\n  | YieldEscrow receives real USDC                                                         |                       PASS |\n  | correct net surplus is negative after settle                                           |                       PASS |\n  | Depends on Operator compromise                                                         |                         No |\n  | Depends on Governor compromise                                                         |                         No |\n  | Depends on upgrade                                                                     |                         No |\n  | Depends on multisig backing                                                            |                         No |\n  | Same as held spot bridge-back bug                                                      |                         No |\n  | Same as uint64 truncation                                                              |                         No |\n  +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+----------------------------+\n  \n  ========================================================================================================================\n  MACHINE-READABLE JSON\n  ========================================================================================================================\n  {\n    \"protocol\": \"Monetrix\",\n    \"surface\": \"accountant_0x811_backing_gate\",\n    \"bug\": \"borrow_lend_liability_ignored\",\n    \"affected_external_function\": \"settle\",\n    \"affected_accountant_function\": \"settleDailyPnL\",\n    \"affected_backing_function\": \"totalBackingSigned\",\n    \"affected_l1_function\": \"_readL1Backing\",\n    \"affected_precompile